Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.50,Default,林晓,0,0,0,,大家好，欢迎来到今天的分享。\N{\rTranslation}Hello everyone, welcome to today's session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:05.00,Default,林晓,0,0,0,,我们先简单回顾一下上周的内容。\N{\rTranslation}Let's first briefly review last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.20,Default,林晓,0,0,0,,上周我们讲了三个关键概念。\N{\rTranslation}Last week we covered three key concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.00,Default,Alice Smith-Johnson， PhD,0,0,0,,They're "ok" with the plan, I think.\N{\rTranslation}They're "ok" with the plan, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.50,Default,Alice Smith-Johnson， PhD,0,0,0,,Let me show the formula: a ＼ b = ｛x｝.\N{\rTranslation}Let me show the formula: a ＼ b = ｛x｝.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,（掌声）\N{\rTranslation}(Applause)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.00,Default,发言人 3,0,0,0,,我想补充一点：<b>重点</b> & 难点要分开看。\N{\rTranslation}One more point: keep the <b>key</b> & hard parts apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.50,Default,张伟,0,0,0,,对，我同意这个看法。\N{\rTranslation}Right, I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.00,Default,张伟,0,0,0,,我也同意，不过有个问题。\N{\rTranslation}I agree too, but I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.00,Default,林晓,0,0,0,,这个问题我们留到最后再讨论。\N{\rTranslation}Let's leave that question for the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.00,Default,Alice Smith-Johnson， PhD,0,0,0,,Sure, sounds good.\N{\rTranslation}Sure, sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:40.00,Default,林晓,0,0,0,,接下来我们要讨论的是一个非常长的句子，它包含了很多很多的内容，目的是让字幕在画面上放不下一行，从而触发带样式字幕的预先折行，确保每一行都不会超出画面的宽度。\N{\rTranslation}Next comes a very long sentence with a great deal of content, meant to be too wide for one line on screen so that styled subtitles break it in advance and no line runs past the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.00,Default,发言人 3,0,0,0,,谢谢大家，我们下次见。\N{\rTranslation}Thanks, everyone. See you next time.
